      "control": {
        "title": "Polling and control",
        "description": "Temperature scaling varies with firmware and is inconsistent in the manual. Verify measurements and setpoints separately against the physical controller. Raw 350 for 35 °C: divisor 10; raw 35 for 35 °C: divisor 1. Hot water defaults to a 65 °C cap, configurable up to 75 °C after checking the installation. Heating is limited to 60 °C by register 0x0301.",
